        <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontSize=12;align=left;spacing=8;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;- TM4C123 as the central controller.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- BLE/UART provides the phone and proximity information&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- the MCU makes the access decision and controls the prototype’s(servo and LEDs).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;- CAN carries the resulting state to another node or an analyzer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;Design note: CAN reports the MCU’s state and should not be required for the local fail-safe lock decision.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
